		(uuid "290bc70c-7448-4574-9759-0d17854df98d"))
	(text "External sensor power is protected by U604 below.\nJP601: solder ONE pair:1-2=3V3,2-3=5V.\nOpen for self-powered sensor; leave J601.1 unconnected.\nNormal sensor + pull-up load budget:25mA."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 30.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1))
			(justify left top))
		(uuid "52bf39b7-ec65-458c-a509-443be8dc1173"))
	(text "INPUT OPTIONS\nDefault: 3.3V / 5V push-pull; pull-ups DNP.\nOpen-drain: fit R608-R610 (4.7k).\nPull-ups follow selected sensor supply.\nDo not fit for externally driven push-pull.\n100k pull-downs define disconnected inputs.\nSingle-ended only; common ground required."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 278.13 35.56 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1))
			(justify left top))
		(uuid "58a58677-84c5-4fe0-af40-6ab59b7fc202"))
	(text "U604: ILIM tied to IN =>75mA nominal (50-100mA).\nEN tied to IN: hardware protection, automatic recovery.\nFAULT_N -> PC13; firmware stops if external feedback is in use."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 213.36 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.016 1.016))
			(justify left top))
		(uuid "8b253014-5408-4246-ba52-eccca940e342"))
	(text "EXTERNAL HALL / ABI: 3.3V or 5V logic -> 3.3V Schmitt buffer -> reset isolation"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8))
			(justify left top))
		(uuid "8b340f1f-4826-402f-849d-b037404521f3"))
	(text "Reset: mux disabled, PB8/BOOT0 held low by R307.\nEN_N=0 enables VM sensing; wait >=2ms before ADC read.\nSEL=0 grounds TIM4 inputs; SEL=1 connects external Hall/ABI.\nOnboard absolute-angle SPI is independent of this switch."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 260.35 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1))
			(justify left top))
		(uuid "d3db0f0d-f90d-4773-8e4c-9f33067d9062"))
